{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Demo Disclaimer:</i></strong><i>\u00a0The demo is still under active development. Currently its goal is to give you a quick introduction to the mechanics in the early stage of the game!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo includes:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 30 board upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ player levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolution tree</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In the full game you will discover over 100+ beautifully hand-drawn elements as you help your World evolve infinitely through time! And finally, maybe, you will know what came first - the chicken, or the egg?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Begin your adventure with a burst of resources! Uncover treasure chests brimming with essential elements to kickstart your evolutionary journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463310/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1740394298\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Core of Creation: Combine simple elements to unlock surprising and satisfying new discoveries. Experiment, innovate, and watch your World transform!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463310/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1740394298\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Even while you're away, your World continues to evolve. Witness the magic of idle progress as your resource collection multiplies and your creation expands. Watch your wealth soar into the millions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463310/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1740394298\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create, explore, and evolve - start your enchanting evolutionary adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463310/extras/Gif_5.gif?t=1740394298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fresh Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/3cc8fece9034b1a8a4eab5170d305edcca8797e3.jpg"},{"name":"Level Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/d4412fcf236a82a7e3a512d5ef88bcb604f96a40.jpg"},{"name":"Mega Merger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/ac0efddf391eaeb262f5043532110597be07bd13.jpg"},{"name":"Elements Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/bf543131aab4dd4a115fa628c31a450ad1c368a3.jpg"},{"name":"Da Powa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/f6fd11eb760e6ce2ef56c9c817d524bb9d49213e.jpg"},{"name":"Waterfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/d6a543eaf254723dfca1897109bf80a53dd3e064.jpg"},{"name":"Maaaan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/1d1d16e52e1dd808f0cfd8b0126035f12b4b8dbb.jpg"},{"name":"Apocalypse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/2e01d9fe9abdc61dba240267735dced7f41f5b40.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/469bac6d7f55e9639f8e7c18289dfe6e50c3fe1c.jpg"},{"name":"Purple Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463310/b0f8cbec033cbecb3b6cd580d46d4d4edb08d50b.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap